        "type": "game",
        "name": "Pinball Hero",
        "steam_appid": 3779500,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779500/extras/404916989b041e7a12f19803a4686a9d.avif?t=1779441329\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> More than 10 Different Pinballs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragging two identical pinballs together allows you to synthesize a higher-level pinball.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Rich and Diverse Monster Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different monsters with unique skill effects are continuously unlocked based on the difficulty of the levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Flexible Level Selection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing each level, you can choose a higher-level stage to earn a higher score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Equipment Selection and Random Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select one piece of equipment when upgrading; both the equipment's quality and stats are random.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Skill Selection and Random Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose one skill when upgrading, with a maximum of 12 skills selectable in total. The skill's cost and CD are somewhat random.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Data Statistics and Analysis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor individually counts the data of each type of pinball, making it easier to make better choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Achievement System and Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After unlocking achievements, you can obtain different initial bonuses.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779500/extras/404916989b041e7a12f19803a4686a9d.avif?t=1779441329\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> More than 10 Different Pinballs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dragging two identical pinballs together allows you to synthesize a higher-level pinball.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Rich and Diverse Monster Types</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different monsters with unique skill effects are continuously unlocked based on the difficulty of the levels.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Flexible Level Selection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing each level, you can choose a higher-level stage to earn a higher score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Equipment Selection and Random Equipment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can select one piece of equipment when upgrading; both the equipment's quality and stats are random.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Skill Selection and Random Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose one skill when upgrading, with a maximum of 12 skills selectable in total. The skill's cost and CD are somewhat random.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Data Statistics and Analysis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each floor individually counts the data of each type of pinball, making it easier to make better choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Achievement System and Rewards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After unlocking achievements, you can obtain different initial bonuses.</p>",
        "short_description": "Defeat rising enemies with physical pinballs. Earn a higher score. Making rational use of equipment, skills, pinball characteristics, and monster characteristics is the key to victory.",
        "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Portugal, Korean",
